{"seq":1,"slug":"unsafe-and-ffi","title":"unsafe Rust 与 FFI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/unsafe-and-ffi","wordCount":831,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"unsafe-rust-与-ffi\">unsafe Rust 与 FFI</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>unsafe</code> 不是&quot;关掉安全检查的开关&quot;，而是<strong>将一小部分安全责任从编译器转移给程序员</strong>：它只解锁编译器无法验证的五种操作，其余借用检查、生命周期与类型安全依然生效。理解本篇的关键，是把握 unsafe 块的真正含义——它是一份<strong>需要被证明的契约</strong>，而非一段&quot;编译器管不着&quot;的代码。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>unsafe 是接口而非豁免</strong>：块的边界即契约边界，进入前需满足的安全不变量应由调用者保证。</li>\n<li><strong>安全抽象是目标形态</strong>：unsafe 代码应被封装在对外安全的 API 内部，使不安全不外泄。</li>\n<li><strong>FFI 是双向信任边界</strong>：<code>extern &quot;C&quot;</code> 两侧的语言对内存、字符串与生命周期的假设不同，因此边界处的验证不可或缺。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"unsafe-的五种超能力\">unsafe 的五种超能力</h2><p><code>unsafe</code> 关键字允许执行编译器无法验证安全性的五种操作。使用 <code>unsafe</code> 不代表代码一定有问题，而是将安全责任从编译器转移到程序员。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>安全 Rust 中是否可用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解引用裸指针</td>\n<td><code>*const T</code> / <code>*mut T</code></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用 unsafe 函数</td>\n<td>标记为 <code>unsafe fn</code> 的函数</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问/修改可变静态变量</td>\n<td><code>static mut</code></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现 unsafe trait</td>\n<td>如 <code>Send</code>、<code>Sync</code></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问 union 的字段</td>\n<td>联合体字段访问</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"裸指针\">裸指针</h2><p>裸指针（Raw Pointer）不受借用检查器约束，可以是空的、悬垂的或未对齐的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    let mut value = 42;&#10;&#10;    let r1 = &amp;value as *const i32;&#10;    let r2 = &amp;mut value as *mut i32;&#10;&#10;    unsafe {&#10;        println!(&quot;r1 指向: {}&quot;, *r1);&#10;        *r2 = 100;&#10;        println!(&quot;r2 修改后: {}&quot;, *r2);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut value = 42;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r1 = &#x26;value as *const i32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let r2 = &#x26;mut value as *mut i32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unsafe {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"r1 指向: {}\", *r1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        *r2 = 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"r2 修改后: {}\", *r2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>裸指针类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>对应安全引用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>*const T</code></td>\n<td>不可变裸指针</td>\n<td><code>&amp;T</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>*mut T</code></td>\n<td>可变裸指针</td>\n<td><code>&amp;mut T</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>关键</strong>：创建裸指针是安全的，<strong>解引用</strong>裸指针才需要 <code>unsafe</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"unsafe-函数与安全抽象\">unsafe 函数与安全抽象</h2><p>unsafe 代码应被封装在安全的 API 内部，对外暴露安全接口。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn split_at_mut(values: &amp;mut [i32], mid: usize) -&gt; (&amp;mut [i32], &amp;mut [i32]) {&#10;    let len = values.len();&#10;    let ptr = values.as_mut_ptr();&#10;&#10;    assert!(mid &lt;= len);&#10;&#10;    unsafe {&#10;        (&#10;            std::slice::from_raw_parts_mut(ptr, mid),&#10;            std::slice::from_raw_parts_mut(ptr.add(mid), len - mid),&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let mut v = vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6];&#10;    let (left, right) = split_at_mut(&amp;mut v, 3);&#10;    println!(&quot;左: {:?}, 右: {:?}&quot;, left, right);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn split_at_mut(values: &#x26;mut [i32], mid: usize) -> (&#x26;mut [i32], &#x26;mut [i32]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let len = values.len();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let ptr = values.as_mut_ptr();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assert!(mid &#x3C;= len);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unsafe {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            std::slice::from_raw_parts_mut(ptr, mid),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            std::slice::from_raw_parts_mut(ptr.add(mid), len - mid),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut v = vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (left, right) = split_at_mut(&#x26;mut v, 3);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"左: {:?}, 右: {:?}\", left, right);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;安全 API 层&quot;] --&gt;|调用| B[&quot;unsafe 实现&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|使用| C[&quot;裸指针操作&quot;]&#10;    A -.-&gt;|对外暴露| D[&quot;安全接口&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"安全 API 层\"] --&gt;|调用| B[\"unsafe 实现\"]\n    B --&gt;|使用| C[\"裸指针操作\"]\n    A -.-&gt;|对外暴露| D[\"安全接口\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"extern-与-ffi\">extern 与 FFI</h2><p>FFI（Foreign Function Interface）允许 Rust 调用 C 函数，也允许 C 调用 Rust 函数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"rust-调用-c\">Rust 调用 C</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"extern &quot;C&quot; {&#10;    fn abs(input: i32) -&gt; i32;&#10;    fn strlen(s: *const std::ffi::c_char) -&gt; usize;&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    unsafe {&#10;        println!(&quot;abs(-5) = {}&quot;, abs(-5));&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>extern \"C\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn abs(input: i32) -> i32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn strlen(s: *const std::ffi::c_char) -> usize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unsafe {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"abs(-5) = {}\", abs(-5));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"c-调用-rust\">C 调用 Rust</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[no_mangle]&#10;pub extern &quot;C&quot; fn rust_add(a: i32, b: i32) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    a + b&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[no_mangle]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub extern \"C\" fn rust_add(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    a + b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对应的 C 头文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"int32_t rust_add(int32_t a, int32_t b);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int32_t</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rust_add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int32_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int32_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cstring-与-cstr\">CString 与 CStr</h2><p>Rust 字符串（UTF-8，不含 null 终止符）和 C 字符串（null 终止的字节序列）之间需要转换。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>拥有者</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>CString</code></td>\n<td>Rust 拥有</td>\n<td>创建传给 C 的字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CStr</code></td>\n<td>借用</td>\n<td>从 C 接收的字符串引用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::ffi::{CStr, CString};&#10;use std::os::raw::c_char;&#10;&#10;extern &quot;C&quot; {&#10;    fn puts(s: *const c_char) -&gt; i32;&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let c_string = CString::new(&quot;Hello from Rust!&quot;).unwrap();&#10;    unsafe {&#10;        puts(c_string.as_ptr());&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;unsafe fn receive_c_string(ptr: *const c_char) -&gt; String {&#10;    let c_str = unsafe { CStr::from_ptr(ptr) };&#10;    c_str.to_string_lossy().into_owned()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::ffi::{CStr, CString};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::os::raw::c_char;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extern \"C\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn puts(s: *const c_char) -> i32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let c_string = CString::new(\"Hello from Rust!\").unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unsafe {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        puts(c_string.as_ptr());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe fn receive_c_string(ptr: *const c_char) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let c_str = unsafe { CStr::from_ptr(ptr) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c_str.to_string_lossy().into_owned()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"bindgen-自动生成绑定\">bindgen 自动生成绑定</h2><p><code>bindgen</code> 从 C 头文件自动生成 Rust FFI 绑定代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml&#10;[build-dependencies]&#10;bindgen = &quot;0.69&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[build-dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>bindgen = \"0.69\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// build.rs&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let bindings = bindgen::Builder::default()&#10;        .header(&quot;wrapper.h&quot;)&#10;        .generate()&#10;        .expect(&quot;无法生成绑定&quot;);&#10;&#10;    let out_path = std::path::PathBuf::from(std::env::var(&quot;OUT_DIR&quot;).unwrap());&#10;    bindings&#10;        .write_to_file(out_path.join(&quot;bindings.rs&quot;))&#10;        .expect(&quot;写入绑定失败&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let bindings = bindgen::Builder::default()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .header(\"wrapper.h\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .generate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .expect(\"无法生成绑定\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let out_path = std::path::PathBuf::from(std::env::var(\"OUT_DIR\").unwrap());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bindings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .write_to_file(out_path.join(\"bindings.rs\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .expect(\"写入绑定失败\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cbindgen-从-rust-生成-c-头文件\">cbindgen：从 Rust 生成 C 头文件</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# cbindgen.toml&#10;language = &quot;C&quot;&#10;include_guard = &quot;MY_LIB_H&quot;&#10;&#10;[export]&#10;include = [&quot;rust_add&quot;, &quot;Point&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># cbindgen.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>language = \"C\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include_guard = \"MY_LIB_H\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[export]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include = [\"rust_add\", \"Point\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"unsafe-最佳实践\">unsafe 最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最小化 unsafe 块</td>\n<td>只在必要处使用 unsafe，缩小范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全抽象包装</td>\n<td>unsafe 代码包装在安全的公开 API 内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>详细记录安全不变量</td>\n<td>用注释说明为什么 unsafe 代码是安全的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 Miri 检测 UB</td>\n<td><code>cargo +nightly miri test</code> 检测未定义行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免 <code>static mut</code></td>\n<td>优先使用 <code>Mutex</code> 或 <code>AtomicXxx</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FFI 边界做好验证</td>\n<td>检查空指针、验证数据有效性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"unsafe fn dangerous_operation(ptr: *const i32) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    // SAFETY: 调用者保证 ptr 非空且指向有效的 i32 值，&#10;    // 且在本函数执行期间不会被修改或释放。&#10;    *ptr&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe fn dangerous_operation(ptr: *const i32) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // SAFETY: 调用者保证 ptr 非空且指向有效的 i32 值，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 且在本函数执行期间不会被修改或释放。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    *ptr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>unsafe</code> 只解锁五种操作：解引用裸指针、调用 unsafe 函数、访问 <code>static mut</code>、实现 unsafe trait、访问 union 字段。</li>\n<li>它转移的是<strong>证明责任</strong>而非放弃检查：块内的类型安全、生命周期仍受编译器约束。</li>\n<li>正确形态是&quot;unsafe 实现 + 安全抽象&quot;：对外暴露安全 API，把不变量与 <code>// SAFETY:</code> 注释留在内部。</li>\n<li>FFI 需要处理字符串表示差异（<code>CString</code>/<code>CStr</code>）、空指针与数据有效性，<code>bindgen</code>/<code>cbindgen</code> 可自动化绑定生成。</li>\n<li>Miri 能检测 unsafe 代码中的未定义行为，应纳入测试流程。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"unsafe Rust 与 FFI","id":"unsafe-rust-与-ffi"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"unsafe 的五种超能力","id":"unsafe-的五种超能力"},{"level":2,"text":"裸指针","id":"裸指针"},{"level":2,"text":"unsafe 函数与安全抽象","id":"unsafe-函数与安全抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"extern 与 FFI","id":"extern-与-ffi"},{"level":3,"text":"Rust 调用 C","id":"rust-调用-c"},{"level":3,"text":"C 调用 Rust","id":"c-调用-rust"},{"level":2,"text":"CString 与 CStr","id":"cstring-与-cstr"},{"level":2,"text":"bindgen 自动生成绑定","id":"bindgen-自动生成绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"cbindgen：从 Rust 生成 C 头文件","id":"cbindgen-从-rust-生成-c-头文件"},{"level":2,"text":"unsafe 最佳实践","id":"unsafe-最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"无锁编程与原子操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/lock-free"},"next":{"title":"内存布局与零成本抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/memory-layout"}}